{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":119529,"Title":"liked a post you made in Dreams Resorts 2016","Message":"Hello!\n\nMegLeLy just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI am looking to book our wedding at Dreams in July 2016 as well\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79546-dreams-resorts-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1905496\n","Sender":{"Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1443354678,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":118134,"Title":"liked a post you made in Newbie Planning Small Weddi...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncycloneusa just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCongrats... I went to Cancunin July for a couple of days and there was a lot of seaweed. I hope your resort we'll have there beach clear. You will have a great wedding.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79559-newbie-planning-small-wedding-at-now-jade-nov-29-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1903967\n","Sender":{"Id":284641,"Name":"cycloneusa","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284641.jpg?_r=1441136033","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442708321,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117477,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nDR2015 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Items!\".\n\nDR2015 said:\n======================================================================\nIf you send me your email I can send photos!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11429&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442434542,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11429},{"Id":116591,"Title":"liked a post you made in Deecol's Planning Threa...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThat is such a amazing story. I am so happy for you that you found you true soal mate. Story's like yours show you can find true love anywhere and never know where you will find it. I know you will have the best wedding you want and having so many friends and family there just shows how your love...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904562\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1442236707,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":116323,"Title":"liked a post you made in Deecol's Planning Threa...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThat is such a amazing story. I am so happy for you that you found you true soal mate. Story's like yours show you can find true love anywhere and never know where you will find it. I know you will have the best wedding you want and having so many friends and family there just shows how your love...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904562\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442149602,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":116282,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nDR2015 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Items!\".\n\nDR2015 said:\n======================================================================\nHello!\n\n\nEverything we have left; ready to ship!\n\n\n-10 table numbers\n\n- 1 bag of seashells\n\n- 1 sandwich bag of orange sand\n\n-1 gold tone headband\n\n-1 pair silver pumps size 9.5 fits like 9\n\n-1 pair of blush Steve Madden Sandals\n\n-1 garter 2pack unopened\n\n-24 bubbles\n\n-2 Gray organza overlays\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11429#msg20418\n","Sender":{"Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442097275,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11429},{"Id":116231,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that deecol mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1904577\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"calgarybride2015\"  That's so beautiful about your parents.  I'm so sorry for the loss of your mom <3\n \nThank you so much for your kind words @\"lorishultz2016\"!  Your post made me smile <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n@\"ashhtayy\" awww our stories are so similar!  So amazing the way things work out  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \nOur price is really good!  I wanted my guests to pay no more than $1400 and ideally around $1200 but I didn't know if it would be possible.  I remember going to a wedding in Cuba in April 2010 and paid $1200 so I wasn't very hopeful that we could get a decent price.  The only thing about our deal is that the final payment is due by October 21st.  There is an early booking bonus included in the price which makes it so low.  I have some friends and family that couldn't commit at the time or be able to pay the balance by the due date and are looking into other options even it means paying more.\n \nI'm working on a thread update right now and will get a dress pic up shortly!  \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1442065560,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114730,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that dreamweddings mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79566-do-your-ownflowers-or-get-the-ones-offered-by-the-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1904201\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nI really want to do my own flowers but wondering about traveling with them. Has anyone did either of these. And if so how did it go.\n-----------------------------\n\n@\"lorishultz2016\"\n \nIt really depends on where you are getting married, if you enjoy DIY and you have time.  I do not see why it would be impossible.  I \u00b4ve had in the past a bride fly from the UK to have a DW in the Riviera maya , and had her own bouquet made from artificial flowers only because she wanted to keep it afterwards.   The centerpieces were real flowers made by a local florist.\n \n \nhope this helps\n \nHappy Planning\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441464781,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114684,"Title":"liked a post you made in Dw Wedding After Postponing...","Message":"Hello!\n\nValentineMrs2Be just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCongratulations I am glad your FH is doing better. And Puerto Rico is really nice. Been there a couple of times. The beaches there are really nice you are going to have a really nice wedding there.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79563-dw-wedding-after-postponing-but-i-am-ok-introducing-me\/?view=findpost&p=1904157\n","Sender":{"Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441394550,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":113074,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tell Me Wedding Planning Do...","Message":"Hello!\n\nhswerdy just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI feel the same way . We want to have our wedding in St Thomas but I want the best hotel and not for sure which one\nto choose. I am so over all this that i dont know where to go next.  \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79540-tell-me-wedding-planning-doesnt-suck\/?view=findpost&p=1903600\n","Sender":{"Id":284587,"Name":"hswerdy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441035056,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":112931,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that jackyrae mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79538-new-bride-for-2017\/?view=findpost&p=1903761\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"lorishultz2016\" I think it would be ok, too. The more I think about it, the more I keep thinking that PLayacar Palace and Dreams Tulum are my top favorites and will be either one I choose. I'm just hoping that my friends (her husband included) wouldn't mind coming back to the Playacar palace again for another wedding. She will definitely be my bridesmaid. I just really loved pretty much everything about the palace and the resort credits are really attracting me there.  So where are you having your wedding at lorishultz\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440980864,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":112692,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that MegLeLy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79526-where-to-go\/?view=findpost&p=1903702\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"lorishultz2016\" \nMy travel agent has been dealing with them so far and while they are slow to respond (few days to a week) they seemed to have good group rates and promotions based on number of rooms booked.   \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440784222,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":111503,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that MegLeLy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79526-where-to-go\/?view=findpost&p=1903405\n\n----------------------------------\nYour welcome @\"lorishultz2016\".    I'm planning my wedding at Dreams La Romana in the Dominican Republic.    \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440541273,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":111082,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding colors","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThank you plum with light purple sounds great together\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/67485-wedding-colors\/?view=findpost&p=1903291\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440449244,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":110498,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome lorishultz2016 to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello lorishultz2016,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destination Wedding Community & Forum (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/)<br \/>Resort Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/resorts-villas)<br \/>Wedding Vendor Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/wedding-vendors)<br \/>Destination Wedding Tips and Articles (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips)<br \/>Wedding Image Gallery (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/recent\/albums)<br \/>BDW Help Page (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=help)<br \/>BDW Forum Rules and Etiquette (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/8853\/forum-faqs-etiquette-rules)<br \/>How to Download Attachments (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/48545\/update-1-18-2010-downloading-attachments)<br \/><br \/>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<br \/><br \/>Moderators and Community Leaders<br \/>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/). Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<br \/>AlexisinJamaica (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/) - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<br \/><br \/>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<br \/>BDW on Facebook (http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Twitter (http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Pinterest (http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/)<br \/><br \/>If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business, please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com (mailto:advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20Inquiry%20for%20BDW).<br \/><br \/>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read! (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010)<br \/><br \/>Please feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.<br \/><br \/>Team BDW\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11191#msg20094\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440276497,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11191}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"15","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
