strawberry filling \n\n\nSo we are going to have both. one flavor per tier.","Attachments":[],"Id":1872820,"PostDate":1411465013,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We just got back from our site visit with Moon Palace.    We got to do the taste test then.  <br><br>\nSince we are having 40+ guests we are going to add a tier to the complimentary cake.  <br><br>\nWe loved both the chocolate cake with chocolate mouse filling and the white strawberry cake with strawberry filling <br><br>\nSo we are going to have both. one flavor per tier. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383035267,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.192.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77885,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6d56f5bb1fd85abff98970bb2996019","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;my cake was a bottom layer was carribean rum cake, middle was redvelet, top was vanilla almond buttercream&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873542,"PostDate":1411816677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>