-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421424569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79160,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by deecol, 07 May 2015 - 04:11 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1431015085,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f6972905d5b8cc5410b28c24dd49274","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You wonderful ladies are probably all over this already. &amp;nbsp;But for anyone like myself who didn&#039;t find this out until today, you can order a free wedding invitation kit from vistaprint.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It was hard for me to pick a size, paper thickness etc without physically seeing it, so I find samples and things like this really helpful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s the link:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/secure.vistaprint.com\/wedding-sample-kit.aspx&#039;&gt;https:\/\/secure.vistaprint.com\/wedding-sample-kit.aspx&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;xoxo&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895688,"PostDate":1431015045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You wonderful ladies are probably all over this already. \u00a0But for anyone like myself who didn't find this out until today, you can order a free wedding invitation kit from vistaprint.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It was hard for me to pick a size, paper thickness etc without physically seeing it, so I find samples and things like this really helpful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's the link:<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/secure.vistaprint.com\/wedding-sample-kit.aspx' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/secure.vista...sample-kit.aspx<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>xoxo<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421424569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79160,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8475bd1daff20384a4eefa6f799ae6f5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"deecol\"] - Thanks! I actually didn&#039;t know about this. I bought a Vistaprint Groupon recently, so this should help me figure out paper, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895713,"PostDate":1431032706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a> - Thanks! I actually didn't know about this. I bought a Vistaprint Groupon recently, so this should help me figure out paper, etc.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417431445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.252.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79160,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"633a39a9ab6437e50478b7799f701536","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;vistaprint is just awesome, you can use their products for so many uses! I&#039;m a bit of a stationery freak. If I had the money I would have gone for really fancy invites but I understand people don&#039;t get stationery like I do so I thought it would have been a waste of money :P.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just got an invite for a friend&#039;s wedding, he and his fiance made them through vistaprint. They were fairly simple, matte paper, but definitely more than what I needed to just go into their website, RSVP and save the date in my calendar :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyway, if they offer free samples that&#039;s a great way to make sure you&#039;re ordering what you want :D&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895727,"PostDate":1431043191,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>vistaprint is just awesome, you can use their products for so many uses! I'm a bit of a stationery freak. If I had the money I would have gone for really fancy invites but I understand people don't get stationery like I do so I thought it would have been a waste of money <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just got an invite for a friend's wedding, he and his fiance made them through vistaprint. They were fairly simple, matte paper, but definitely more than what I needed to just go into their website, RSVP and save the date in my calendar <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyway, if they offer free samples that's a great way to make sure you're ordering what you want <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79160,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":6,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a96406781251ccb31910fe16fdfefd3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve said this a million times throughout different forums but I&#039;ll say it again, I am SO thrilled with how my Vistaprint invitations turned out.&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] I used a Groupon too (I got the $100 for $200 worth of stuff one) and was able to upgrade all my paper with money to spare. I ordered the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(56,69,79);font-family:MarkPro, sans-serif;\"&gt;Premium White Matte Stock&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;and it was perfect for the invitations. I used the linen finish for the menus which I love, too. Very happy with everything all around!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80986]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895735,"PostDate":1431066780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've said this a million times throughout different forums but I'll say it again, I am SO thrilled with how my Vistaprint invitations turned out.\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> I used a Groupon too (I got the $100 for $200 worth of stuff one) and was able to upgrade all my paper with money to spare. I ordered the\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(56,69,79);font-family:MarkPro, sans-serif\">Premium White Matte Stock<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0and it was perfect for the invitations. I used the linen finish for the menus which I love, too. Very happy with everything all around!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80986-img-4363\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18013\/sml_gallery_275855_18013_998028.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 4363'  width='200' height='151'  alt='IMG 4363' id='sml_image_view_80986' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388713897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1435853657","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.58.42.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79160,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac36839984e8934ff063df4d381c4911","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have got your post and thought on it, I was thinking there are many websites out there who are doing the work to satisfy the customer with their work; I have seen many who are giving the samples (free and paid) before making and order, just to see the quality and othetr features of the product.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899479,"PostDate":1435573368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have got your post and thought on it, I was thinking there are many websites out there who are doing the work to satisfy the customer with their work; I have seen many who are giving the samples (free and paid) before making and order, just to see the quality and othetr features of the product.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andrew.lon@outlook.com.au","IpAddress":"50.31.30.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435228590,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"alastair","Id":283690,"Name":"alastair","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.108.62.147","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79160,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a89ca18e08c7f1bbe994ff2556df734","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow, your print are amazing. &amp;nbsp;Do you remember the name of the template in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Vistaprint inventory?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899978,"PostDate":1436337382,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n  