as amazing food. My resort showed low availability too but my agent got me a block by wiggling the dates just a bit. I would be happy to refer them if you&#039;d like.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898108,"PostDate":1433780866,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Have you tried getting a travel agent to try to get a block of rooms for you? Azul has amazing food. My resort showed low availability too but my agent got me a block by wiggling the dates just a bit. I would be happy to refer them if you'd like.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexamiri7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.69.100.245","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433264419,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283361.jpg?_r=1433388782","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AlexandraAmiri","Id":283361,"Name":"AlexandraAmiri","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.33.96.77","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79248,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99df14ecefd6744eeaf4242e86569afc","RawContent":"I winded up booking the Royalton Riviera Cancun! Is there a forum for this resort?? I know it&#039;s fairly new!","Attachments":[],"Id":1898129,"PostDate":1433799141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I winded up booking the Royalton Riviera Cancun! Is there a forum for this resort?? I know it's fairly new!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"reginakrachak@gmail.com","IpAddress":"100.33.96.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433452231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283386.jpg?_r=1433470594","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ReginaKay","Id":283386,"Name":"ReginaKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79248,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1433975272,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8088afdeec213e67033bfa71621129c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think you found it. You&#039;ve already posted there.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76750-new-resort-royalton-riviera-cancun\/?p=1842110&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76750-new-resort-royalton-riviera-cancun\/?p=1842110&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898134,"PostDate":1433806645,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think you found it. You've already posted there.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76750-new-resort-royalton-riviera-cancun\/?p=1842110' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ncun\/?p=1842110<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417431445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79248,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by deecol, 10 June 2015 - 08:58 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1433926681,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4321f50b81db333ce60fcef6777be16b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ReginaKay\"] &amp;nbsp;First of all, CONGRATS! (I&#039;m an April 2016 bride too!)&amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve booked at the Grand Bahia Principe Coba. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m not sure where you are based but we were able to get it for under $1300 for our Canadian guests from April 26-May 3rd and about 800GBP for our UK guests.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s just over and hour drive but the price is great and the resort is beautiful. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m not sure about the wheelchair access but it&#039;s a huge resort so I can&#039;t imagine them not having this.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just an option to look into! &amp;nbsp;Good luck! xo&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898293,"PostDate":1433926653,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283386\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283386-reginakay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ReginaKay<\/span><\/a> \u00a0First of all, CONGRATS! (I'm an April 2016 bride too!)\u00a0I've booked at the Grand Bahia Principe Coba. \u00a0I'm not sure where you are based but we were able to get it for under $1300 for our Canadian guests from April 26-May 3rd and about 800GBP for our UK guests.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's just over and hour drive but the price is great and the resort is beautiful. \u00a0I'm not sure about the wheelchair access but it's a huge resort so I can't imagine them not having this.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just an option to look into! \u00a0Good luck! xo<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421424569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.75.97.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79248,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"754fa0162ee153ad3c07105d1010571c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"deecol\"] Congratulations to you too! Yay for April brides haha! I booked the Royalton Riviera Cancun! April 11th is our wedding date. So exciting! Best of luck to you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Regina&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898295,"PostDate":1433926987,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a> Congratulations to you too! Yay for April brides haha! I booked the Royalton Riviera Cancun! April 11th is our wedding date. So exciting! Best of luck to you.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- Regina<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"reginakrachak@gmail.com","IpAddress":"100.33.96.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433452231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283386.jpg?_r=1433470594","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ReginaKay","Id":283386,"Name":"ReginaKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79248,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by deecol, 10 June 2015 - 09:08 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1433927322,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a076e8add68df881824b00503f48aecc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ReginaKay\"] Congratulations on booking your wedding!!! &amp;nbsp;(Sorry! I just saw you wrote that 2 posts above!) &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898297,"PostDate":1433927279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n     